{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985570/extras/embrance_call_of_the_cosmos__1_.png?t=1744145730\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985570/extras/header_new.gif?t=1744145730\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Cosmic Cosmonaut, you take the helm as a fearless Soviet space explorer.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985570/extras/zoom-3-export.gif?t=1744145730\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore a vast frontier</strong>, filled with awe-inspiring nebulae, vibrant planets, and curious moons. Each celestial body holds its own secrets and challenges. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985570/extras/ezgif-3-0f61a2359e.gif?t=1744145730\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Intriguing Alien Encounters</strong>: Meet a menagerie of alien species, each with their own unique cultures, technologies, and needs. Befriend them, trade with them, or overcome them in strategic challenges. All characters fully voiced! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985570/extras/ruri-2-export-2-export.gif?t=1744145730\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Galactic Commerce</strong>: Utilize your trusty spaceship as a vessel for intergalactic trade. Buy low, sell high, and amass resources to upgrade your ship and fulfill lucrative contracts for the Soviet Union. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985570/extras/trade-export.gif?t=1744145730\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Serve the Motherland</strong>: Earn prestige and advancements by fulfilling missions for the Soviet space program. Discover valuable resources, forge alliances with friendly alien civilizations, and secure the Union's place in the cosmos!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985570/extras/battle-3-export.gif?t=1744145730\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985570/extras/New_Project__2_.png?t=1744145730\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Exploration</strong>: Seek out new worlds and uncover the mysteries of the galaxy.<br><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diplomacy and Trade</strong>: Build relationships with alien species and manage your balance sheet.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985570/extras/management.gif?t=1744145730\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Strategic Depth</strong>: Navigate diverse challenges and make critical decisions that impact your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A touch of Cold War flair</strong>: Represent the Soviet Union with pride as you and your fleet explore and exploit the vastness of space.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985570/extras/Become_a_pioneer.png?t=1744145730\" /></p><p class=\"bb_parag